                "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"es\">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <title>Alerta de Sistema - Handly</title>\r\n  <style>\r\n    body { font-family: {{25.font_family}}; background-color: {{25.bg_main}}; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #e2e8f0; }\r\n    .container { max-width: 620px; margin: 30px auto; background-color: #1e293b; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #334155; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\r\n    .header { background: {{25.brand_primary_gradient}}; padding: 20px 25px; color: #ffffff; }\r\n    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }\r\n    .badge { display: inline-block; background-color: {{25.brand_primary}}; color: #ffffff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }\r\n    .content { padding: 25px; }\r\n    .alert-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: {{25.brand_primary}}; margin-bottom: 12px; }\r\n    .message { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 20px; }\r\n    .card { background-color: {{25.text_dark}}; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\r\n    .card-title { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\r\n    .data-row { padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; }\r\n    .data-label { color: #94a3b8; }\r\n    .data-value { font-weight: 600; color: #f8fafc; font-family: monospace; background-color: #1e293b; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }\r\n    .code-block { background-color: #020617; border: 1px solid #1e293b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: {{25.brand_primary}}; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; }\r\n    .footer { background-color: {{25.bg_main}}; padding: 16px 25px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; }\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n  <div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\"><h1>⚠️ Unhandled Webhook Event</h1><div class=\"badge\">Error de Ruteo / Fallback</div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n      <div class=\"alert-title\">Evento no procesado en la automatización</div>\r\n      <div class=\"message\">El escenario de Make/n8n recibió una petición webhook con un tipo de evento que no coincide con ninguno de los filtros configurados en el Router.</div>\r\n      <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Detalles de la Petición</div>\r\n        <div class=\"data-row\"><span class=\"data-label\">Event Type recibido:</span><span class=\"data-value\">{{2.event_type}}</span></div>\r\n        <div class=\"data-row\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><span class=\"data-label\">Destinatario original:</span><span class=\"data-value\">{{2.recipient_email}}</span></div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Payload Recibido (Raw JSON)</div>\r\n      <div class=\"code-block\">{\r\n  \"event_type\": \"{{2.event_type}}\",\r\n  \"recipient_email\": \"{{2.recipient_email}}\",\r\n  \"data\": {{2.data}}\r\n}</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"footer\">Alerta automática para Dev/Staff • <strong>Handly Core System</strong></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
                "subject": "⚠️ [Handly System Alert] Evento de webhook no reconocido: {{2.event_type}}",
                "sendEmailAs": "html"
